---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="What AIGameDevHub is, and how the free resource curation works."
>
  <section class="container page-head">
    <p class="mono eyebrow">About the hub</p>
    <h1>Free AI + game-dev, loud on purpose</h1>
    <p>
      AIGameDevHub is a third-party catalog for free tools — local AI, animation, Godot resources,
      and shaders. Not the official Godot project — just loud fans. We only spotlight free lanes and
      expect you to verify licenses before you ship. See our{" "}
      <a href="/godot" style="color: var(--mint)">Godot love page</a>
      and the live{" "}
      <a href="/community" style="color: var(--mint)">r/aigamedev feed</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container about-grid">
    <article>
      <h2>Always-free rule</h2>
      <p>
        If it needs a paid plan to be useful, it doesn’t belong here. We favor local models, open
        tools, and community packs you can actually use today.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>External vs ours</h2>
      <p>
        <span class="tag mono tag-coral">External</span> /
        <span class="tag mono tag-lime">Free AI</span> links belong to other creators.
        <span class="tag mono tag-lime">Ours</span> means hub drops like DimePlayer.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>What’s next</h2>
      <p>
        More AI workflows, animation finds, and tiny Godot drops. No accounts, no uploads — just a
        sharp shelf to browse.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .about-grid article {
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about-grid h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .about-grid p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--steel-bright);
  }
</style>
